Fixes legacy defect L-00: the TopLevelRuntime lowering counted FUNCTION/SUB lines inside DECLARE LIBRARY as procedure openings, so main-module code after the block stayed in the main body while code before it moved into SUB QBNEX_TOPLEVEL_RUNTIME0 (never called before SYSTEM, with its own local variables). The legacy build prints "after 0" / "y 1" only. Expected output is QBasic source order.
